<sparse-coo-docs>` with specified values at the given
:attr:`indices`.

.. note::

   This function returns an :ref:`uncoalesced tensor
   <sparse-uncoalesced-coo-docs>` when :attr:`is_coalesced` is
   unspecified or ``None``.

.. note::

